  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3229.05 Front Wheel Geometry",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3229.05 Front Wheel Geometry.\n\n(a) All motorcycles shall meet the following for the front wheel geometry:\n\n(1) Maximum rake - 45 degrees;\n\n(2) Minimum rake - 20 degrees;\n\n(3) Maximum trail - 14 inches positive; and\n\n(4) Minimum trail - 2 inches positive.\n\n(b) The requirements set forth in (a)(2) and (a)(4) above shall not apply to 3 wheel motorcycles.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by 11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
